  "id": "rehearsal",
  "term": "rehearsal",
  "definition": "Rehearsal, in this learning context, means mentally repeating the steps of a task by picturing them in the mind after seeing them. It is used as a supplement to hands-on practice to help learners move toward skilled performance, especially in learning how to carry out procedures.",
